OL,3,GNEWSAMilitary museum turned art and
OL,4,Aculture space opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former military museum has reopened
OL,7,Fas an arts and culture venue.
OL,9,FOver the past two years, the former
OL,10,FDurham Light Infantry (DLI) Museum
OL,11,Fbuilding at Aykley Heads, Durham, has
OL,12,Fbeen almost completely rebuilt.
OL,14,FNow called The Light, its first
OL,15,Fexhibition features different artists'
OL,16,Fexperiments with light and showcases a
OL,17,Freplica of the first British lightbulb,
OL,18,Fcreated by Sunderland-born physicist
OL,19,FJoseph Swan.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
