OL,3,GNEWSAMilitary museum turned art and
OL,4,Aculture space opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FDurham County Council's cabinet member
OL,7,Ffor leisure and tourism Karen Allison
OL,8,Fsaid the venue would "celebrate County
OL,9,FDurham's heritage and innovative
OL,10,Fspirit".
